repository-code: 'https://github.com/fennicahub/fennica-statistical-programming-lesson'
abstract: >-
  An introductory lesson on statistical programming in R for
  researchers and students in the humanities and library and
  information science. Using the Fennica national bibliography
  (1809-1917) as a running example, learners load, clean,
  summarise, visualise and statistically analyse a real
  bibliographic dataset.
keywords:
  - R
  - statistics
  - bibliographic data
  - Fennica
  - digital humanities
  - The Carpentries
